gDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/59"> Restriction of disclosure of information.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/59A">59A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/59A">Exception to restriction: public authorities</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/60">60.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/60">(1) . . . . . . . . ....</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/6162.">61, 62.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/6162.">. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/crossheading/offences-penalties-and-legal-proceedings"> Offences, Penalties and legal Proceedings</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/63">63.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/63"> Offences.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/64">64.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/64">. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . </a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/section/6566.">65, 66.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1963/41/sec